cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Ladrillo, please cite it as below."
title: "Ladrillo.jl: a calibrated reduced-complexity emulator of global mean sea level rise"
type: software
## The version the GMD paper reports is 1.0.0 (Marcus 2026-11-11): v0.4's model and numbers plus the figure scripts.
## The internal builds are tags v0.1.0-v0.4.0 (tagged v1.0.0-v1.3.0 until the release). Set date-released, and tag
## v1.0.0, at the release commit; update both at each later tagged release. (date-released is added then.)
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/msarofim/Ladrillo.jl"
authors:
  - family-names: Sarofim
    given-names: Marcus C.
    affiliation: "NYU Marron Institute"
## The model-description paper (Geoscientific Model Development, in preparation) becomes `preferred-citation` once it
## has a DOI; the software DOI goes in `doi:` when the release is archived.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "MimiBRICK.jl"
    version: 2.0.0
    url: "https://github.com/raddleverse/MimiBRICK.jl"
